  "body": "A rare opportunity to secure a quality family home in one of Mairangi Bay’s most desirable neighbourhoods, offering an exceptional combination of premium school zones, stunning coastal views, privacy and easy beachside living.\r\n\r\nPrivately tucked away on a quiet street, well away from busy through traffic, this home enjoys a peaceful setting with established trees and natural screening providing excellent privacy from neighbouring properties. A wonderful sense of space and seclusion makes this an ideal retreat for family life.\r\n\r\nThe spectacular outlook across the bay is a real highlight. Enjoy beautiful sea views and breathtaking sunrises over the ocean, while the north-east facing aspect welcomes the morning sun and fills the home with natural light.\r\n\r\nBuilt by the current owner just six years ago and exceptionally well maintained, the home offers peace of mind with a Master Build Guarantee. Quality is reflected throughout, including low-maintenance James Hardie exterior cladding and two beautifully customised kitchens. Designed in collaboration between the owner and builder, the kitchens feature carefully selected materials, quality finishes and thoughtful detailing beyond standard builder specifications.\r\n\r\nDesigned with growing and extended families in mind, the spacious layout offers four generous bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms, a separate study, two kitchens, multiple living areas, a sunny balcony, internal-access garage and additional off-street parking. Excellent separation of living spaces provides flexibility for family living, working from home or accommodating guests.\r\n\r\nDouble glazing adds year-round comfort and helps reduce outside noise. Downstairs, a covered outdoor deck creates a sheltered space for children and pets, making the most of the home's practical indoor-outdoor living.\r\n\r\nThe location completes the picture. Within walking distance of Mairangi Bay Beach and the popular seaside village, you'll enjoy easy access to cafés, restaurants, bars, supermarkets and everyday amenities. Excellent schooling is another major drawcard, with zoning for Mairangi Bay School, Rangitoto College and Westlake Boys' and Girls' High Schools.\r\n\r\nCombining sought-after school zones, a peaceful and private setting, beautiful coastal outlooks and quality construction, this is a home that offers both lifestyle and long-term appeal.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this opportunity. Contact us today to arrange your viewing!",
